<title>USA: NationsBank near deal to buy Montgomery - CNBC.</title>
<headline>NationsBank near deal to buy Montgomery - CNBC.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>NationsBank Corp is close to announcing a $1 billion deal to buy Montgomery Securities, CNBC reported Thursday.</p>
<p>A spokeswoman for San Francisco-based Montgomery said no announcemebnt had been made. She added that in the past the company has said it was considering selling a stake, but has not diclosed who it was in talks with or whether an agreement had been reached.</p>
<p>Officials for NationsBank, which is based in Charlotte, North Carolina, could not immediately be reached for comment.</p>
</text>
